<title>PERU: Peru's Backus y Johnston Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Peru's Backus y Johnston Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 67.63 million soles vs 95.35 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 447.14 million soles vs 422.71 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Cerveceria Backus y Johnston SA is Peru's largest brewery.</p>
